      "body": "@DinosL apologies. My minimal reproduction was run inside a transaction in my test application. I have confirmed that the following will reproduce it on `v1.5.2`:\n\n```sql\nBEGIN;\nCREATE TABLE t (d DATE);\nINSERT INTO t VALUES (DATE '2026-05-18');\nSELECT * FROM t WHERE d = (SELECT MAX(d) FROM t WHERE d <= DATE '2025-03-15');\n```",
